{"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"level":2,"text":"Overview","type":"heading","anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Each standard value has an enricher of its own, and nothing is added to a record until the app"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"builds its tracker with that enricher. Each one sets a typed "},{"code":"ServiceContext","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" key whose value a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination reads from the record’s context: "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/ApplicationKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeviceKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":","},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/OperatingSystemKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/LocaleKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/NetworkKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey","type":"reference","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":". The first five are in the "},{"code":"Events","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":" module, as a store keeps them beside"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"each record, so a record recovered after a relaunch carries the values it was tracked with. This"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"module reads the values the platform reports."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The app, device, operating system and locale are read once, when the enricher is made, never per","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"event. The network connection changes while the app runs, so on Apple platforms ","type":"text"},{"code":"network()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" starts","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"an ","type":"text"},{"code":"NWPathMonitor","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" of its own and sets the latest connection on each record. Give each tracker its","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"own call. Off Apple platforms there is no device and no path monitor, so those two enrichers set","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"nothing, and a server or tool, whose process usually has no Info.plist, passes its own app to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"application(_:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"code":"vendorIdentifier()","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", made on the main actor, adds the platform’s identifier for vendor as a","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"code":"Sensitive","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" value. It is the one identifier here that outlives a session, so add it only when the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app has decided to and has the user’s consent. It is never stored or made up: on macOS and Linux,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"which have none, records carry no key, and a store never writes it.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"For the session an event was tracked in, use "},{"code":"Sessions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":"."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["import StandardContext","import Trackers","","let tracker = Tracker(enrichers: [.application(), .operatingSystem(), .locale(), .network()])","tracker.track(SignedUp(plan: \"pro\"))","\/\/ A destination reads each value from the record's context:","\/\/ record.context[ApplicationKey.self]?.version, record.context[OperatingSystemKey.self]?.name"],"type":"codeListing"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"The guide ","type":"text"},{"identifier":"https:\/\/tyler-keith-thompson.github.io\/Traffluent\/documentation\/traffluent\/sessionsandstandardcontext","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"covers each value and the identifier for vendor in more detail.","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[[]]},"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Stamp every event with the app, device, operating system, locale and network connection it was tracked on."}],"topicSections":[{"anchor":"The-app","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/application(_:)"],"title":"The app"},{"anchor":"The-device","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/device(_:)"],"title":"The device"},{"anchor":"The-operating-system","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/operatingSystem(_:)"],"title":"The operating system"},{"anchor":"The-locale","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/locale(_:)"],"title":"The locale"},{"anchor":"The-network-connection","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/network()"],"title":"The network connection"},{"anchor":"The-identifier-for-vendor","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events\/Enricher\/vendorIdentifier()","doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/VendorIdentifierKey"],"title":"The identifier for vendor"},{"anchor":"Extended-Modules","identifiers":["doc:\/\/StandardContext\/documentation\/StandardContext\/Events"],"title":"Extended Modules","generated":true}],"sections":[],"metadata":{"roleHeading":"Framework","role":"coll